---
// Today's stack (with an AI agent on top) next to the folded stack. Used in "The Answer Was Already in the Weights".
---

<figure class="diagram">
  <div class="cols">
    <div>
      <p class="label">Today, with an AI agent</p>
      <ol class="stack">
        <li class="you">You</li>
        <li class="agent">AI agent, clicking for you</li>
        <li>Application</li>
        <li>Browser &amp; GUI</li>
        <li>Operating system</li>
        <li>Programming language</li>
        <li>Machine code</li>
        <li class="hw">Hardware</li>
      </ol>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="label">Folded: translate only at the edge</p>
      <ol class="stack">
        <li class="you">You</li>
        <li class="new">Edge Translator</li>
        <li class="new">Models, talking in types &amp; vectors</li>
        <li class="hw">Hardware</li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    Every middle layer on the left exists to meet humans halfway. Today's agents add one more layer on
    top. Take away the need for human-readable steps and most of those layers have nothing left to do.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .cols {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }
  .label {
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-3);
  }
  .stack {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .stack li {
    position: relative;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0.45rem 0.75rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--surface-2);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .stack li + li {
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
  }
  .stack li + li::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    top: calc(-0.8rem - 1px);
    height: 0.8rem;
    border-left: 1px solid var(--text-3);
  }
  .you {
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .agent {
    border-color: var(--role-change) !important;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--role-change) 12%, var(--surface)) !important;
  }
  .new {
    border-color: var(--accent) !important;
    background: var(--accent-soft) !important;
    color: var(--accent-ink);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .hw {
    border-style: dashed !important;
    background: transparent !important;
    color: var(--text-3) !important;
  }
  @media (max-width: 520px) {
    .cols {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
